# Starts a new GDI campaign from the main menu: the choice of side, whose
# pictures are movie frames and so not in the screenshot, the briefing, and
# the first mission under way.
at 300 shot main_menu
at 301 click 320 58
at 500 shot choose_side
at 501 click 160 200
at 3000 shot mission_start
at 9000 shot mission_under_way
at 9001 quit
